  "calibration": "All cost coefficients are provisional gameplay, not official prices or national military accounts.",
  "limitations": [
    "Equipment archetype versus derived-family aggregation is not proven in the native engine. Each armor family uses max(parent, sum distinct derived archetypes), a conservative lower bound if they are disjoint, rather than charging aliases twice. Legacy named-equipment aliases are not also queried.",
    "Designer modules can add secondary aircraft types. Each airframe pays one total-aircraft base; one maximum observed role-premium pool is added. This deliberately underestimates some mixed fleets rather than summing overlapping role counts.",
    "Stockpile equipment, support equipment embedded in rail supply, reserves, fuel consumption, aircraft age, flight hours and individual unit availability are not separately observable or billed by these proxies. Native physical supply/fuel/replacement remains authoritative."
  ]
